<title>USA: Vencor extends Transitional offer again.</title>
<headline>Vencor extends Transitional offer again.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said Tuesday it has extended the expiration date of its $16.00 per share cash tender offer to acquire all of the outstanding shares of Transitional Hospitals Corp June 18, 1997.</p>
<p>Vencor said that about 27.7 million shares of Transitional's common stock have been tendered.</p>
<p>The tender offer has previously bneen extended to June 10 from June 4, when about 10.7 million shares had been tendered.</p>
<p>Transitional has about 38.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
